findings.proposed_fix:
Line 919: replace
        require ee ge e or IsDivisibleBy(a,2^(e-ee)): "Target modulus must be divisible by conductor";
with
        require ee ge e or (IsDivisibleBy(a,2^(e-ee)) and (s eq 1 or ee ge 2)): "Target modulus must be divisible by conductor";
(when a<>0 the existing divisibility test already forces ee>=3, so the extra clause only rejects the previously-missed a=0, s=-1, ee<2 case; a=0, s=1 means the 2-part is trivial and never reaches this branch).

